錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-songshu052-xie-support-chun-spouse-yu","subject_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","predicate":"spouse","object_person_id":"6ja_oyv_lve","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"純妻庾"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-current-rendered-xiejingren-near-family","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003","quote":"述字景先，少有志行，隨兄純在江陵。純遇害，述奉純喪還都。行至西塞，值暴風，純喪舫流漂，不知所在，述乘小船尋求之。經純妻庾舫過，庾遣人謂述曰：「喪舫存沒，已應有在，風波如此，豈可小船所冒？小郎去必無及，寧可存亡俱盡邪。」述號泣答曰：「若安全至岸，當須營理。如其已致意外，述亦無心獨存。」因冒浪而進，見純喪幾沒，述號叫呼天，幸而獲免，咸以為精誠所致也。高祖聞而嘉之，及臨豫州，諷中正以述為主簿，甚被知器。景仁愛其第三弟甝而憎述，嘗設饌請高祖，希命甝豫坐，而高祖召述。述知非景仁夙意，又慮高祖命之，請急不從。高祖馳遣呼述，須至乃歡。及景仁有疾，述盡心營視，湯藥飲食，必嘗而後進，不解帶、不盥櫛者累旬，景仁深懷感愧。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0009","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0010"}],"interpretation_note":"依本完整選段的原詞、本人及客體錨點保存；編者組裝另存，不補生母、無名父或未載排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-song052-chun-wife-yu","person_id":"6ja_oyv_lve","surname":"庾","ming":null,"additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0010","source_anchor":{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered